<p>20   Alan Shearer (Newcastle)</p>
<p>17 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>12 - Robbie Fowler (Liverpool), Dwight York (Aston Villa),</p>
<p>Les Ferdinand (Newcastle)</p>
